    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DPL302m · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DPL302m · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Convolutional Neural Networks</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/convolutional-neural-networks?specialization=deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/convolutional-neural-networks?specialization=deep-learning</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Deep Learning Specialization</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/deep-learning</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>GP 1: Diabetes Disease Detection with XG-Boost and Neural Networks</strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/diabetes-disease-detection-with-xg-boost-and-neural-networks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/diabetes-disease-detection-with-xg-boost-and-neural-networks</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>GP 2: Hyperparameter Tuning with Keras Tuner</strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/keras-tuner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/keras-tuner</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>GP 3: Object Localization with TensorFlow</strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/object-localization-tensorflow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/object-localization-tensorflow</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>GP 4: NLP: Twitter Sentiment Analysis</strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/twitter-sentiment-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/twitter-sentiment-analysis</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Improving Deep Neural Networks: Hyperparameter Tuning, Regularization and Optimization</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/deep-neural-network?specialization=deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/deep-neural-network?specialization=deep-learning</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Neural Networks and Deep Learning</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/neural-networks-deep-learning?specialization=deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/neural-networks-deep-learning?specialization=deep-learning</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Sequence Models</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/nlp-sequence-models?specialization=deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/nlp-sequence-models?specialization=deep-learning</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Structuring Machine Learning Projects</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>DeepLearning.AI · Coursera</p><p><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/machine-learning-projects?specialization=deep-learning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/machine-learning-projects?specialization=deep-learning</a></p></div>"
